         t - Tower of Tir-Talath","  +--f--v--c--+   E +     +     +     +       ","  |           |   | |     |     |/    |               I    2    T","  +--e--a--g--+   L-+     +  Z--t--+  +              /    /    /","  |           |     |     |     |     |             +----1----+  ","  +--i--M--h--+   +-+-s   +     +     +                 /| C     ","  |  |  |  |  |   | |     |           |                / |/  ","  +--+--+--+--+   F +     +--+--+--+--+               t  +","                    |","              NorthernRoads","","A - Armory","a - Alanna (Flower stall)","b - Bank","B - Bard","c - Dairy Shack","C - Conjurer","d - Druid","D - Diana (Brass Gauntlets, Shield bearing the Insignia of Tir-Talath)& Well","e - Spice Market","E - Thieves Guild (Poisoness Stiletto)","f - Fruit Stand","F - Farrier (Centaur/Mino gear)","g - Bakery","h - Confectioner's (candy store)","I - Invoker","i - Basket Weaver's","K - Baron's Keep","L - The Laughing Dragon (Inn)","M - The Meat Market","P - Pit / Recall (Up to 'The Temple Arboretum')","R - Ranger","s - Supply Depot (general store)","S - Sleeping Quarters","t - Tower of Tir-Talath","T - Transmuter","u - Wells, 'use well' twice then 'drink well'","v - Vegetable Stand","W - Warrior Guild","w - Weaponsmith's","z - Free Wine!!! =]","Z - Zardroff (Alchemist)","","0 - ground level  (can go up)","1 - one level up  (can go down (and up if in tower or keep))","2 - two levels up (can go down)","","Within the vast northern plains region south of the Udgaard Mountains, ","several farms and agricultural communities are nestled. Rising up in ","the midst of the vast, sweeping grasslands, is the Tir-Talath Outpost. ","Serving as a common center of commerce, defense, and study, Tir-Talath ","is a formidable fortress in a land often plagued by bandits, natural ","disasters, and an aggressive neighboring territory. ","","Visitors are welcome in Tir-Talath, which boasts several amenities in a ","region otherwise limited to rather rural conditions. A temple in service ","to the wise and neutral gods of the Theran pantheon offers healing services ","and sanctums for prayer, and the open barracks of the Tir-Talath militia ","welcome any visitors who wish to study the art of war within. The majestic ","Tower of Tir-Talath offers a place of magical study for both mages and ","amateurs alike, while the sights and smells of the farmer's market are sure ","to delight the sense of anyone seeking a unique farm grown gift or treat. ","","Order in Tir-Talath is kept by the local militia, who defend the northern ","plains region and its people under the high command of Baron Telenius, a ","reluctant, but well-trusted patron who rarely grants audiences to visitors. ","His personal keep, however, is open to visitors, and stands proudly in the ","heart of the outpost on top of a secure cistern from which the outpost draws ","water into its four wells."],"plus_cells":[{"row":1,"column":6},{"row":1,"column":12},{"row":3,"column":6},{"row":3,"column":9},{"row":3,"column":12},{"row":5,"column":3},{"row":5,"column":6},{"row":5,"column":9},{"row":5,"column":12},{"row":5,"column":15},{"row":5,"column":18},{"row":5,"column":21},{"row":5,"column":24},{"row":5,"column":27},{"row":5,"column":30},{"row":5,"column":33},{"row":5,"column":36},{"row":5,"column":39},{"row":7,"column":3},{"row":7,"column":15},{"row":7,"column":18},{"row":7,"column":21},{"row":7,"column":24},{"row":7,"column":27},{"row":7,"column":30},{"row":7,"column":39},{"row":9,"column":3},{"row":9,"column":6},{"row":9,"column":9},{"row":9,"column":12},{"row":9,"column":15},{"row":9,"column":18},{"row":9,"column":21},{"row":9,"column":24},{"row":9,"column":27},{"row":9,"column":30},{"row":9,"column":36},{"row":9,"column":39},{"row":11,"column":3},{"row":11,"column":9},{"row":11,"column":15},{"row":11,"column":18},{"row":11,"column":21},{"row":11,"column":24},{"row":11,"column":27},{"row":11,"column":33},{"row":11,"column":39},{"row":12,"column":56},{"row":12,"column":6